  "slug": "red-lentil-and-tofu-curry",
  "title": "Red Lentil and Tofu Curry",
  "blurb": "A straightforward curry with soft lentils and firm tofu in a spiced broth, finished with fresh coriander.",
  "steps": [
    "Peel and finely chop the onion, then peel and crush the garlic.",
    "Cut the tofu into cubes about two centimetres across.",
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat, add the onion and cook for four minutes until softened.",
    "Stir in the garlic, curry powder and cayenne, cook for one minute, then add the lentils and water.",
    "Bring to a simmer, cover and cook for fifteen minutes until the lentils are tender.",
    "Add the tofu and salt, simmer for three more minutes to heat through.",
    "Roughly chop the coriander and stir it through just before serving."
  ],
